; lowering-runtime corpus: provenance / diagnostic path. The hook emits
; `sugar-normal` with the author's `:a` value (a number); `sugar-normal`
; declares `:a` as a string. Re-validating the lowered tree fires
; `wrong_underlying` at the lowered form — but the diagnostic span
; points back at the source `(sugar …)` via the inherited span. The
; conformance harness asserts on (code, path); span tracing is pinned
; by the in-source unit test in Host_tests.zig.
(plugin :name probe :version "1.0.0"
  (form :name sugar
    (key :name a :type number)
    :lowering (lowering :hook test/identity-v1 :produces [sugar-normal]))
  (form :name sugar-normal
    (key :name a :type string)))

(sugar :a 1)
